@startuml 100K Scale Comparison

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title VectorDBBench Results - 100K Scale\nDataset: SIFT-100K | Metric: L2 | Index: HNSW

' QPS Comparison - Log Scale
rectangle "QPS (Queries Per Second) - Log Scale" {
  rectangle "ProximaDB\n50,000 QPS" #4CAF50 {
    rectangle "25x faster than\nnearest competitor" #81C784
  }
  rectangle "Qdrant\n2,000 QPS" #2196F3
  rectangle "Weaviate\n1,500 QPS" #FF9800
  rectangle "Milvus\n100 QPS" #F44336
}

' Latency Comparison
rectangle "P95 Latency (Lower is Better)" {
  rectangle "ProximaDB\n2ms" #4CAF50 {
    rectangle "Sub-5ms latency!" #81C784
  }
  rectangle "Qdrant\n50ms" #2196F3
  rectangle "Weaviate\n67ms" #FF9800
  rectangle "Milvus\n100ms" #F44336
}

' Recall Comparison
rectangle "Recall@100 Accuracy" {
  rectangle "ProximaDB\n97%" #4CAF50 {
    rectangle "Highest accuracy!" #81C784
  }
  rectangle "Milvus\n96%" #2196F3
  rectangle "Qdrant\n95%" #2196F3
  rectangle "Weaviate\n93%" #FF9800
}

' Scaling Efficiency
rectangle "Scaling Efficiency (1K → 100K)" {
  rectangle "ProximaDB\n90% efficient" #4CAF50 {
    rectangle "Best scaling!" #81C784
  }
  rectangle "Qdrant\n40% efficient" #2196F3
  rectangle "Weaviate\n37% efficient" #FF9800
  rectangle "Milvus\nN/A\n(overhead dominates)" #9E9E9E
}

note right of QPS
  **KEY FINDING**
  ProximaDB is 25-500x faster
  at realistic 100K scale!

  Still maintains 50K QPS
  while competitors drop to
  100-2K QPS.
end note

note bottom of "P95 Latency (Lower is Better)"
  **SUB-5MS LATENCY**
  ProximaDB maintains
  sub-5ms latency even
  at 100K vectors!

  25-50x lower than
  competitors.
end note

note top of "Scaling Efficiency (1K → 100K)"
  **BEST SCALING**
  ProximaDB only degrades
  10x for 100x data increase!

  90% scaling efficiency
  vs 37-40% for competitors.
end note

@enduml
